{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus: GDo & Juice WRLD]\n[00:24.50] You know I don't act right, act right\n[00:27.46] Sippin' Act' right while I song write\n[00:30.56] I can see her face in the fog lights\n[00:33.40] Let's get to the chase, have a long night\n[00:36.40] Been a long day, been a long ride\n[00:39.38] Flag on the play that shit offsides\n[00:42.36] Now I'm getting high till I'm upside\n[00:44.62] Down in the dumps, but I'm high, so it's alright\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:46.84] She tell me that it's all my fault\n[00:49.88] Alright, been a long night hoping that I won't die\n[00:53.60] Remember when I met you on the North Side\n[00:55.42] Panties had you wetter than your first time\n[00:59.08] Super wet, yeah when I flex\n[01:02.04] 'Cause she love it when I flex\n[01:04.30] I'ma hit it from the back\n[01:06.54] She don't stand a chance\n[01:08.82] But my heart under attack\n[01:10.24] I got too over-attached\n[01:12.54] No, not again, no not again\n[01:16.30] I got too over-attached\n[01:18.60] Once you leave, you know she ain't coming back\n[01:21.48] She with him, so I know she won't hit me back\n[01:24.48] No, not again, no not again\n[01:28.24] I got too over attached\n[01:30.52] Once you leave, you know she ain't coming back\n[01:33.44] She with him, so I know that she with hit me back\n[Chorus: GDo & Juice WRLD]\n[01:40.48] You know I don't act right, act right\n[01:42.30] Sippin' Act' right while I song write\n[01:43.58] I can see her face in the fog lights\n[01:44.84] Let's get to the chase, have a long night\n[01:48.00] Been a long day, been a long ride\n[01:50.98] Flag on the play that shit offsides\n[01:53.96] Now I'm getting high till I'm upside\n[01:56.20] Down in the dumps, but I'm high, so it's alright\n[Verse 2: GDo]\n[02:00.00] I know I don't act right\n[02:01.90] Last time couldn't really be our last time\n[02:04.82] Getting high, anticipating my last flight\n[02:07.68] In other worlds, loving you is like suicide\n[02:10.46] I don't wanna lose\n[02:12.56] Go do what you do\n[02:14.60] I won't pity the fool\n[02:16.14] I'm gon' tell you the truth\n[02:18.22] Are you ready for the truth?\n[02:20.34] 'Cause the truth ready for you\n[02:22.20] Feel like you were mine in a past life\n[02:25.26] Now I'm too addicted to the fast life\n[02:28.70] I just had a blast like last night\n[02:31.18] Could've flat lined\n[02:32.34] But I only poured a half pint\n[02:34.30] I don't wanna lose\n[02:36.40] Go do what you do\n[02:38.48] I won't pity the fool\n[02:39.96] I'm telling you the truth\n[02:42.06] Are you ready for the truth?\n[02:44.26] Cause the truth ready for you","words":[[6.24,6.98,"[Chorus:"],[7.04,7.08,"GDo"],[7.1,7.9,"&"],[9.08,9.38,"Juice"],[9.52,10.0,"WRLD]"],[24.5,24.56,"You"],[24.64,24.82,"know"],[24.92,24.92,"I"],[24.98,25.24,"don't"],[25.28,25.34,"act"],[25.6,25.94,"right,"],[26.0,26.08,"act"],[26.12,26.36,"right"],[27.46,27.88,"Sippin'"],[28.02,28.18,"Act'"],[28.22,28.5,"right"],[28.54,28.8,"while"],[28.88,28.88,"I"],[28.94,29.18,"song"],[29.34,29.7,"write"],[30.56,30.56,"I"],[30.62,30.7,"can"],[30.78,30.92,"see"],[30.96,31.04,"her"],[31.14,31.5,"face"],[31.6,31.66,"in"],[31.7,31.76,"the"],[31.88,32.2,"fog"],[32.28,32.84,"lights"],[33.4,33.56,"Let's"],[33.62,33.74,"get"],[33.8,33.88,"to"],[33.98,34.04,"the"],[34.16,34.52,"chase,"],[34.56,34.74,"have"],[34.78,34.78,"a"],[34.9,35.16,"long"],[35.3,35.62,"night"],[36.4,36.54,"Been"],[36.6,36.6,"a"],[36.76,37.04,"long"],[37.14,37.38,"day,"],[37.52,37.68,"been"],[37.74,37.74,"a"],[37.88,38.14,"long"],[38.28,39.1,"ride"],[39.38,39.74,"Flag"],[39.84,39.92,"on"],[40.0,40.08,"the"],[40.12,40.4,"play"],[40.5,40.62,"that"],[40.68,40.9,"shit"],[41.04,41.66,"offsides"],[42.36,42.48,"Now"],[42.56,42.64,"I'm"],[42.72,43.02,"getting"],[43.12,43.4,"high"],[43.44,43.56,"till"],[43.6,43.78,"I'm"],[44.0,44.56,"upside"],[44.62,44.94,"Down"],[45.04,45.1,"in"],[45.14,45.2,"the"],[45.36,45.66,"dumps,"],[45.72,45.78,"but"],[45.82,45.86,"I'm"],[45.9